# Mappers Folder

## Overview
This folder contains data mapper classes responsible for converting between domain entities and database models.

## Purpose
- **Entity-to-DTO Mapping**: Transforms domain entities into Data Transfer Objects for API responses
- **DTO-to-Entity Mapping**: Converts incoming Data Transfer Objects into domain entities for business logic
- **Database Model Mapping**: Handles conversion between ORM models and domain objects

## Contents
Mapper classes follow naming conventions: `[EntityName]Mapper.cs`

## Usage
Mappers are typically used in repository layers and service classes to maintain separation of concerns between data access and business logic layers.
